  "releaseNotes": "v1.2026.6.1 - Added Security Roles section\n\t\t\t- Display team security roles\n\t\t\t- Assign/Remove security roles to selected team and save to Dynamics\n\t\t\t- Export selected team, team users and security roles\n\t\t\tv1.2026.5.4 - Load all Teams, Users for selected BU\n\t\t\t- Export all teams and Users \n\t\t\t- Export feature for selected team and users\n\t\t\tv1.2026.5.1 - Initial release\n\t\t\t- Visualize Business Unit hierarchy in tree view\n\t\t\t- Drill down from BU → Teams → Users\n\t\t\t- View team types (Owner, Access, AAD Security, AAD Office)\n\t\t\t- Display user email addresses\n\t\t\t- Expand/collapse hierarchy controls\n\t\t\t- Clean, intuitive interface",
